    <description>Zenthera Patient Support Program (demo, fictional data). Read-only care team handoff: reads the facts from Salesforce records (PSP_CareTeamHandoff Apex), then writes the handoff with the PSP Care Team Handoff Summary prompt template. If the AI is unavailable, returns the factual handoff. Creates, changes or posts nothing.</description>
